# CODEOWNERS
#
# Maps each language's PO catalogs to that language's translator, so
# they're automatically requested for review on changes to their own
# language. This does not restrict who can open a PR touching that
# path -- anyone can still contribute to any language -- it just adds
# the assigned translator as an auto-requested reviewer.
#
# See phpbbdocs-hugo's docs/translation-process-prompt.md and the
# Translator Workflow wiki page for how translators are onboarded.
#
# No entries yet. Add one per line as translators join, in the form:
#   /<code>/ @their-github-username
#   /terminology/<code>/ @their-github-username
#
# Example, once someone joins as the German (de) translator:
#   /de/ @their-github-username
#   /terminology/de/ @their-github-username
